{"id":"dostoinstvo","lemma":"достоинство","pos":"noun","rank":3462,"glosses":["positive quality","dignity, self-respect","denomination, value (of a banknote)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c3/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"достоинства","plural":"достоинства"},"examples":[{"text":"Где твоё достоинство?","en":"Where is your dignity?","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"your","l":"твой"},null]},{"text":"Он всё время превозносит её достоинства.","en":"He spends all his time extolling her virtues.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,null,null,{"g":"her"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"all along"]]},{"text":"Я потерял свое достоинство.","en":"I've lost my dignity.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to lose, to waste","l":"потерять"},null,null]},{"text":"У неё нет чувства собственного достоинства.","en":"She has no self-esteem.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},null,{"g":"no / there isn't"},{"g":"sense, feeling","l":"чувство"},null,null]},{"text":"Между мной и тобой разница в том, что у меня есть достоинство.","en":"The difference between you and me is that I have class.","words":[{"g":"between, among"},{"g":"I","l":"я"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"},{"g":"difference"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},{"g":"there is / to eat"},null]}]}